  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"taxon\": \"Macropoma lewesiensis (Mantell, 1822)\", \"representation\": \"Conservative complete living fish restoration, not fossil slab or exact individual scan\", \"context\": {\"era\": \"cretaceous\", \"age\": \"Late Cretaceous, Turonian to possibly Santonian for species\", \"locality\": \"Southern England Chalk; type from Lewes, Sussex\", \"note\": \"No Lower Cretaceous gombessae morphology or material mixed.\"}, \"forbidden\": [\"Scale photograph as exactly60cm specimen\", \"Label historical mantelli as a second distinct species\", \"Mix gombessae, precursor, modernLatimeria or priorCoelacanthus model anatomy\", \"Expose fossil vertebrae, calcified swim bladder or broken body holes on living model\", \"Long central tail whip, generic teleost fork, merged median fins\", \"Photo textures, imported meshes, extra concept images, labels or plinth\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"taxon\": \"Macropoma lewesiensis (Mantell, 1822)\", \"representation\": \"Conservative complete living fish restoration, not fossil slab or exact individual scan\", \"context\": {\"era\": \"cretaceous\", \"age\": \"Late Cretaceous, Turonian to possibly Santonian for species\", \"locality\": \"Southern England Chalk; type from Lewes, Sussex\", \"note\": \"No Lower Cretaceous gombessae morphology or material mixed.\"}, \"forbidden\": [\"Scale photograph as exactly60cm specimen\", \"Label historical mantelli as a second distinct species\", \"Mix gombessae, precursor, modernLatimeria or priorCoelacanthus model anatomy\", \"Expose fossil vertebrae, calcified swim bladder or broken body holes on living model\", \"Long central tail whip, generic teleost fork, merged median fins\", \"Photo textures, imported meshes, extra concept images, labels or plinth\"]}"
  },
